# Template skin - appearance half (blank; exercises the per-part fallback)
#
# Copy this directory to SYS:Classes/ReIncarnation/Mods/<Name>/, set NAME
# below to the same <Name>, add image files beside it, and uncomment the
# lines you supply art for. Every part WITHOUT art renders through the
# procedural Classic path, so a partial skin is legal (design E0-2).
#
# Format 1 rules (gui/skin.h; fail-closed: one malformed line rejects the
# whole file):
# - Printable ASCII only (plus TAB/CR/LF); lines at most 255 bytes.
# - FORMAT, NAME, VERSION are required and must be the first three keys,
#   in this order. NAME = [A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,63} and must equal the directory
#   name. VERSION = 1..65535; raise it whenever the art changes (songs
#   store it with the mod's SHA-256).
# - '#' starts a comment line; unknown keys are ignored.
# - Sections and control kinds are NAMES, never numbers:
#     sections: 303 808 909 mix-303a mix-303b mix-808 mix-909 master
#               pcf delay dist comp transport pat-303a pat-303b pat-808
#               pat-909   (both synths share the "303" art)
#     kinds:    knob fader switch button led step selector display meter
#   A section or kind this build does not know is ignored (it belongs to a
#   later build's device); its line is still syntax-checked.
# - part = [A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,48}, named by ROLE, never by pixel size.
# - file = image path relative to this directory, PNG/RGBA recommended
#   (per-pixel alpha survives picture.class; ILBM cannot carry alpha).
# - NFRAMES = frames in a vertical strip, 1..256 (64 = classic look).
# - Art is authored at 2x (2x-master px == panel Q units). Its size is
#   checked against the panel when the mod loads: a part of the wrong size
#   is drawn Classic and reported, never cropped or stretched.
FORMAT=1
NAME=Template
VERSION=1
#
# Section backdrops (size = the section at 2x):
# BACKGROUND.303=bg303.png          1464x460
# BACKGROUND.808=bg808.png          1472x468
# BACKGROUND.909=bg909.png
# BACKGROUND.mix-303a=bgmix.png
# BACKGROUND.master=bgmaster.png    332x464
# ... one per section name above.
#
# Knob frame strips (value->frame is value*frames/128, see ri_skin_frame):
#   knob.frame        = the section's largest knob (e.g. 808 Level, 40x56)
#   knob.frame.small  = its other knob size (e.g. 808 Tone/Tune, 36x44)
# PART.303.knob.knob.frame=knob303.png,64          84 x (120*64)
# PART.808.knob.knob.frame=knob808.png,64          40 x (56*64)
# PART.808.knob.knob.frame.small=knob808s.png,64   36 x (44*64)
# PART.909.knob.knob.frame=knob909.png,64          44 x (52*64)
# PART.mix-303a.knob.knob.frame=knobmix.png,64     45 x (70*64)
# PART.delay.knob.knob.frame=knobfx.png,64         48 x (80*64)
# PART.transport.knob.knob.frame=knobtr.png,64     50 x (90*64)
#
# Reserved role names (no call sites yet):
# PART.<section>.fader.fader.cap=<file>,1
# PART.<section>.step.step.lit=<file>,1
# PART.<section>.display.digit.strip=<file>,10
